  hints:
  - "Dani needs to reach the lever high up on the ledge. She cannot get there alone."
  - "Scarlet can carry Dani on her shoulders. Walk Scarlet close to Dani and press USE to lift her up, then walk to the ledge wall and press USE again to set her down."
  - "Lift Dani onto the raised ledge, then switch to Dani and walk north to the lever. Pulling it opens the exit for Scarlet. Then bring both siblings to the glowing circle."
